@startuml CU-07
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (detalle)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /catalog /cart" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CatalogService, CartService / garment, cart" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: abrir prenda
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /catalog/{id}
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get(db, garment_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: detalle + variantes
Ctrl --> UI : 5: CatalogItemRead
UI --> Cli : 6: vista con selector

Cli -> UI : 7: elegir variante
UI -> Ctrl : 8: POST /cart/items
Ctrl -> Model : 9: add_item(db, cart, …)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: CartRead
Ctrl --> UI : 11: carrito actualizado
UI --> Cli : 12: confirmación

@enduml